From ccf6926b31db803ddb031b9306f0e879cb88adf2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brandon Williams <turbine.bmw@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 22:09:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2330/2368] media: qcom: camss: x1e80100: optional full IFE
 window dump at pixel path stop

pix_dump_window=<bytes> maps the IFE block from its physical base and logs
every nonzero 32-byte row when the PIX line stops, to locate the image
processing module registers that the DT window does not cover. Bring-up
aid, not for upstream.

Signed-off-by: Brandon Williams <turbine.bmw@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 31b7aa7fa5a76a3937b04cfee69037affa6e1817)

